==German==

===Etymology===
Related to [[schlagen]] (see [[Schlag]]), which is related to Greek [[κλάδος]] ''(kládos)'', “[[branch]]”; see [[cladistics]]. Not related to ''[[schlecht]]''. See also [[ge-#German|ge-]].

